<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Jekyll on Basil Labib</title><link>https://basil08.github.io/tags/jekyll/</link><description>Recent content in Jekyll on Basil Labib</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><managingEditor>gs454236@gmail.com (Basil Labib)</managingEditor><webMaster>gs454236@gmail.com (Basil Labib)</webMaster><copyright>© 2020–2026 Basil Labib</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 21 Jun 2021 10:34:14 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://basil08.github.io/tags/jekyll/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Migrating From Jekyll to Hugo</title><link>https://basil08.github.io/post/migrating-from-jekyll-to-hugo/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Jun 2021 10:34:14 +0530</pubDate><author>gs454236@gmail.com (Basil Labib)</author><guid>https://basil08.github.io/post/migrating-from-jekyll-to-hugo/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a quick note for the convenience of the readers.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;With a heave of pleasant sigh, I can inform you all that &lt;strong&gt;I am migrating from &lt;a href="https://jekyllrb.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;jekyll&lt;/a&gt;&#10; to &lt;a href="https://gohugo.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;hugo&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/strong&gt;. Finally.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The only hindrance (so to speak) was the choice of a decent theme which, as you can see, has been accomplished. Hugo has a ton of features and conveniences that I would be foolish to not take advantage of. Archetypes, built-in shortcodes, KaTeX typesetting, taxonomies beside being so fast! I love Hugo. &amp;#x1f49c;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;figure class="image-caption image-zoom-container"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="img-19de44d9" class="image-zoom-toggle" /&gt;&#10; &lt;label for="img-19de44d9" class="image-zoom-label"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://basil08.github.io/img/jekyll-blog.png" alt="Old Blog (Jekyll) Home Page" loading="lazy" class="zoomable-image" /&gt;&#10; &lt;/label&gt;&#10; &lt;label for="img-19de44d9" class="image-zoom-overlay"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://basil08.github.io/img/jekyll-blog.png" alt="Old Blog (Jekyll) Home Page" class="zoomable-image" /&gt;&#10; &lt;/label&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption&gt;Old Blog (Jekyll) Home Page&#10; &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;figure class="image-caption image-zoom-container"&gt;&lt;input type="checkbox" id="img-dd0d46aa" class="image-zoom-toggle" /&gt;&#10; &lt;label for="img-dd0d46aa" class="image-zoom-label"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://basil08.github.io/img/hugo-blog.png" alt="New Blog (Hugo) Home Page" loading="lazy" class="zoomable-image" /&gt;&#10; &lt;/label&gt;&#10; &lt;label for="img-dd0d46aa" class="image-zoom-overlay"&gt;&#10; &lt;img src="https://basil08.github.io/img/hugo-blog.png" alt="New Blog (Hugo) Home Page" class="zoomable-image" /&gt;&#10; &lt;/label&gt;&#10; &lt;figcaption&gt;New Blog (Hugo) Home Page&#10; &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#10;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 id="a-word-of-caution-skull"&gt;A word of caution &amp;#x1f480;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;It is quite obvious, migration is neither a quick nor an exciting task. This will take time. I plan to complete it in parts over multiple days. So don&amp;rsquo;t freak out if some link is broken or you find &lt;em&gt;&amp;ldquo;gibberish text&amp;rdquo;&lt;/em&gt; written midway through a post. And, I am looking into alternatives to Disqus.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;To infinity and beyond. &amp;#x1f680;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;</description></item></channel></rss>